    "通常与进餐相关，服药后应按医嘱进食。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "This medicine is usually taken in relation to meals. Eat as directed after taking it."
          }
