            "value" : "通常可隨餐或空腹服用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通常安排在早晨，具体按药袋或处方。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "This medicine is usually taken in the morning. Follow the label or prescription."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
